      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحِيثٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْثٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A secret:</i> whence the
prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَا بَحِيثُهُمْ</span> [<i>Their secret became apparent,</i>
